 ◆ PSEUDOSCOPE  Help

╭─ Keys ─────────────────────────────────────────╮╭─ Colours ──────────────────────────────────────╮
│ → ←      one step forward, one back            ││                                                │
│ Space    plays / pauses                        ││   5       being read                           │
│ ↑ ↓      faster, slower                        ││   5       just written, result                 │
│ n        steps over the call                   ││   5       where we are                         │
│ u        out of the subprogram                 ││  sort     procedures and functions             │
│ g        to the end (or to ●)                  ││  Node     types and records                    │
│ 0        starts again                          ││  ─▶       pointers                             │
│ b        breakpoint ● on the line              ││   ✗       error, false                         │
│ Enter    more detail                           ││   ·       no value yet                         │
│ Esc      less detail                           ││                                                │
│ 1 … 5    straight to a level                   ││                                                │
│ Tab      other view or variable                ││  Level: what you see, and the step             │
│ m        other component (States)              ││  1        System: a message                    │
│ f        code or activity diagram              ││  2        Program: a call                      │
│ v        arrays as cells or bars               ││  3        Function: a statement                │
│ o        what was printed                      ││  4        Statement: a piece of it             │
│ d        what was drawn                        ││  5        Memory: a read or a write            │
│ c        the whole story                       ││                                                │
│ x        back to exploring                     ││                                                │
│ q        quit                                  ││                                                │
│                                                ││                                                │
│                                                ││                                                │
│                                                ││                                                │
│                                                ││                                                │
╰────────────────────────────────────────────────╯╰────────────────────────────────────────────────╯

